          "stats": {
            "id": "levelled_description_cfdbb24d908e",
            "level": {
              "value": 6
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "You shape your kinetic aura into swirling armor of steam that scalds your enemies and propels you on super-heated jet streams. A creature can take damage from Steam Knight only once per round. Your steam armor has the following effects.\n\n- You gain a +10-foot status bonus to your Speed.\n- When you Leap, you can jump up to your Speed. You don't immediately fall at the end of a jump, provided you Leap again with your next action. If you Leap over a creature and come within 10 feet, that creature takes 2d6 fire damage with a basic Reflex save against your class DC.\n- At the start of each of your turns, you can emit steam as a free action. It deals 2d6 fire damage to each creature in your kinetic aura with a basic Reflex save against your class DC. A creature that fails is also pushed 5 feet."
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
